  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"745\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"256\" rowspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"115\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"90\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/m_t.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/m_s.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_s_stone/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/s_1.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_s_mar/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/s_2.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_s_tower/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/s_3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_s_wo/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/s_4.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_s_field/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/s_5.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_s_brick/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/s_6.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_s_st/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/s_7.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_s_co/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/s_8.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_s_wp/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/s_9.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/m_l.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_l_sand/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/l_1_1.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_l_log/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/l_1.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_l_via/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/l_2.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_l_mar/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/l_3.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_l_brick/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/l_4.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_l_pat/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/l_5.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_l_st/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/l_6.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_l_wood/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/l_7.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/f_f.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_f_tower/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/f_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_f_keep/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/f_2.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/skill/house_f_ca/\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/f_3.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></a></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"10\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/m_b.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;집짓기</b></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp; \n            \n            </p><table border=\"\" bordercolor=\"silver\" bordercolordark=\"silver\" cellspacing=\"0\" height=\"28\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"top\" height=\"28\" width=\"550\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/t_logo.gif\" width=\"300\"></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<ul>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>울온이</b> \n                    다른 여타 머그겜과확연히 구분되어지는 것은 자신만의 집을</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">질 \n                    수 있다는 것입니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">이제 \n                    자신의  집을 갖는다는 즐거움을 마음껏 누리시길~</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>울온상에서</b> \n                집을 짓기 위해서는 일단 지형이 평지이어야 합니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">물론 \n                평지이고 장애물이 없을지라도 </font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">허가된지역에서만 \n                질 수 있습니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>1</b>. 하나의 계정내 오직 한캐릭만 \n                한샤드네에서 집을 소유할 수 있습니다.</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">p.s : 일단 집을 가지게 되면 그캐릭으로는 \n                집을 지을 수가 없습니다.하지만 만일 다른캐릭으로</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">또다른 집을 짓게 되면 다른 한집은 \n                리플(집이 무너지는 것을 방지)이 안됩니다...</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">그시간내에 한집을 팔아치우든지 \n                 허물어뜨리면됩니다.</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">다른사람집에 \n                    코오너(공동소유주)가 되었어도 집을 가진 것처럼 인식이됩니다.</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">자신이 \n                    집을 짓게 된다면 코오너도 푸시길..</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>2</b>. 만약 집을 짓게 되면 집을 가로막던 \n                아템이나 동물 사람은 집밖으로 튕겨져 나갑니다.</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>3</b>. 집주변으로의 모든방향으로 1칸의 \n                빈공간이 있어야 합니다.</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>4</b>.돌이나 나무는 바로옆에 지셔도 \n                되지만 근처에 다른 집이 있다면 </font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">앞뒤로 \n                    5칸의 여유공간이 있어야 합니다. 좌우로는 1타일의 공간정도도 \n                    허용합니다.</font></p>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>5</b>.돌이나 \n                    버섯,꽃중에서 아래와같은 것들은 무시되어 지어지는 경우가 \n                    있습니다</font></p>\n<div align=\"left\">\n<table border=\"1\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"70%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"56\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/a1.gif\" width=\"44\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/a10.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"50\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"42\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"59\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/a11.gif\" width=\"44\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"50\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/a14.gif\" width=\"63\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"50\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/a15.gif\" width=\"43\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"36\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/a16.gif\" width=\"32\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"55\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/a13.gif\" width=\"63\"></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/a17.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"40\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"41\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"55\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/a2.gif\" width=\"40\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/a3.gif\" width=\"32\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"47\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/a4.gif\" width=\"42\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"50\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/a5.gif\" width=\"65\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/a6.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"38\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"42\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/a7.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"56\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"44\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"50\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/a9.gif\" width=\"43\"></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/b1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"26\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"17\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/b10.gif\" width=\"18\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"14\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/b11.gif\" width=\"17\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"12\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/b12.gif\" width=\"13\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/b13.gif\" width=\"16\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"21\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/b2.gif\" width=\"30\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/b3.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"29\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"24\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/b4.gif\" width=\"34\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/b5.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"23\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"21\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/b6.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"21\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"27\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/house/b7.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"32\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"32\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"31\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/b8.gif\" width=\"25\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"19\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/house/b9.gif\" width=\"30\"></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;출처[UOSS]</b></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>6.</b>물이찬배럴통이 \n                    집짓는데 잇다면 빈병으로 물을뺀후 집을지시기 바랍니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>7</b>.집안에 \n                    아템고정시키기</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;LockDown</b> \n                    : 집에 물체나 컨테이너를 고정시킵니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">물론 \n                    고정된 컨테이너에 아템을 넣으면 락다운수도 증가됩니다.또한 \n                    넣은 아이템도 </font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">컨테이너박스안에서자동 \n                    고정이 됩니다. 그러므로 꺼내실 때마다 릴리즈하셔야 </font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">하는 \n                    불편이 있습니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Secure \n                    Box</b> : 컨테이너 상자를 잠금장치를 해둡니다.한상자안에는 \n                    125개의 아템을 넣을 수 있고</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">그숫자125개는 \n                    락다운수에 포함이됩니다 작은집이 시큐어박스가 3개허용이라고해도</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">3개를 \n                    시큐어 하면 락다운갯수가 375로 자연 지정이 됩니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">작은집의 \n                    락다운 허용갯수가 425므로 여기서 325를 빼면 실제 락다운 \n                    할수잇는갯수는</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">100개로 \n                    한정이 됩니다..</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">만약 \n                    락다운을 100개 초과한후 3개의 시큐어를 시도할려고하면 실패 \n                    할 것입니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">-_-;;;쉽게 \n                    설명하자면 허용치의 시큐어하실상자는 매상자마다 락다운 갯수가 \n                    125개이상의 </font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">여분이 \n                    있어야 합니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">I \n                    wish to lock down this(고정)</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">I \n                    wish to secure this(잠금)</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">I \n                    wish to release this(락다운이나 시큐어상태를 풉니다)</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">I \n                    wish to place a trash barrel(쓰레기통을 만듭니다-자리가 \n                    맘에 안드시면 도끼나할바드</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">2번클릭 \n                    쓰레기통을 클릭~)</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">.</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>8.</b>집무너지는 \n                    단계 메시지(집간판 한번클릭)</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">like new approx. 50 분전에 \n                    리플함<br>slightly worn 2일에서 3일s<br>somewhat worn 2일에서 \n                    3일<br>fairly worn 2일에서 3일<br>greatly worn 2일에서 3일<br>in danger of \ncollapsing 18시간에서 24시간</font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">실제로 \n                    하우스 헌터라는 알려지지 않는 직업들이 있습니다</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">무너지는 \n                    집들을 찾아다니는 직업입니다^^ 레어와 마찬가지로 끈기와 \n                    노력이 필요한</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">난위도 \n                    있는 스킬중에 하나입니다...</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">p.s \n                    : 집간판옵션은 UO.Tip란에 집간판옵션을 참조하시길.....</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>Wrritten \n                    By </b></font><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Forg</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n",
